{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45604","headline":"春晚书山家屋壁二首 二 · 贯休","name":"春晚书山家屋壁二首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"水香塘黑蒲森森，鸳鸯鸂鶒如家禽。\n前村後垄桑柘深，东邻西舍无相侵。\n蚕娘洗茧前溪渌，牧童吹笛和衣浴。\n山翁留我宿又宿，笑指西坡瓜豆熟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贯休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_45604.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45604","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}